  "id": "passive-attention",
  "term": "passive attention",
  "definition": "Passive attention is a mental state in which a person simply looks at and notices a target stimulus without doing an added mental task such as counting or imagery. In this source, it is contrasted with more effortful forms of attention and is associated with weaker event-related brain responses.",
